Chapter: StarterKit
  cites Uoaix chapter GameSkillsItems
  cites Uoaix chapter GameCombat

 A new character starts with its trade's lowest-tier tool, blessed, and one piece of cured meat (UOAIX.md section 5,
 skills; Skills.md, the profession kits). The 1.25 client sends three chosen skills and their values at bytes 74-79 of
 the 0x00 creation packet; the trade is the highest. Tool art is TILEDATA's: shovel 0x0F39 (Mining 45), saw 0x1034
 (Carpentry 11), smith's hammer 0x13E3 (Blacksmithy 7), sewing kit 0x0F9D (Tailoring 34), fishing pole 0x0DBF (Fishing
 18), hatchet 0x0F43 (Lumberjacking 44), butcher knife 0x13F6 (Cooking 13), longsword 0x0F61 (Swordsmanship 40), bow
 0x13B2 (Archery 31), mortar and pestle 0x0E9B (Alchemy 0), spellbook 0x0EFA (Magery 25). The client has no jerky;
 its sausage 0x09C0 stands in.
  pk-meat : Integer = #09C0
  pk-art : Integer -> Integer
  pk-art (skill) = if skill == 45 then #0F39 else if skill == 11 then #1034 else if skill == 7 then #13E3
    else if skill == 34 then #0F9D else if skill == 18 then #0DBF else if skill == 44 then #0F43
    else if skill == 13 then #13F6 else if skill == 40 then #0F61 else if skill == 31 then #13B2
    else if skill == 0 then #0E9B else if skill == 25 then #0EFA else 0
  pk-trade : List Integer -> Integer
  pk-trade (packet) = if list-length packet < 80 then -1
    else let a = list-at packet 75
    in let b = list-at packet 77
    in let c = list-at packet 79
    in if a >= b & a >= c then list-at packet 74 else if b >= c then list-at packet 76 else list-at packet 78
 The mark of a blessed item is its health 30001 (GameCombat cb-blessed), a value no key, door, deed, seed or potion
 holds: chest keys stop at 16385 and door keys start at 32768.
  pk-make : GsiState, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Boolean -> Result (List Integer) Text
  pk-make (items) (pack) (art) (health) (x) (stack) = when world-create items.world (__record-set (__record-set (__record-set (gs-item pack art 0) "x" x) "y" 80) "health" health)
    is Err (e) -> Err e
    is Ok (serial) -> if gsi-register items serial 0 0 True stack /= 0 then Err "starter kit registration refused"
      else when world-get items.world serial
        is Err (e) -> Err e
        is Ok (made) -> Ok (sip-item made)
  pk-grant : GsiState, Integer, List Integer -> Result (List (List Integer)) Text
  pk-grant (items) (serial) (packet) = let pack = gsi-pack-find items.world serial 0
    in let art = pk-art (pk-trade packet)
    in if pack == 0 | world-room items.world < 2 then Ok []
    else when pk-make items pack pk-meat 0 90 True
      is Err (e) -> Err e
      is Ok (meat) -> if art == 0 then Ok [meat]
        else when pk-make items pack art cb-blessed 60 False
          is Err (e) -> Err e
          is Ok (tool) -> let touched = world-item-touch items.world in Ok [meat, tool]
